Exynos9610 gta4xl camera bring-up (S5K4HA / S5K5E9 + CSIS)

Add a local raw-Bayer capture path for the SM-P615 cameras.  The sensors
are driven over the two PERI CAMI2C buses and the CSIS receiver writes
packed RAW10 frames directly to memory with its VC-DMA.  The downstream
FIMC-IS/3AA/ISP firmware stack is intentionally not used.

This adds the camera power domain, CMU_CAM provider, sysmmu_cam, both
CSIS ports, the sensor nodes, fixed load-switch regulators and the
main PMIC camera rails, plus the USI-2 reset/interrupt handling needed
by the HSI2C controllers.  Register tables and sequences are derived
from the LineageOS 4.14 gta4xl kernel.

